- \`ingest.connection.settings.path\`: \`abfss://landing@crmdev.dfs.core.windows.net/crm\` → \`abfss://landing@crmprod.dfs.core.windows.net/crm\`
- \`timezone\`: \`Europe/London\` → \`UTC\`

## Table orders

- \`full name\`: \`dev.bronze.orders\` → \`prod.bronze.orders\`
