- \`timezone\`: \`Europe/London\` → \`UTC\`

## Table customers_clean

- \`full name\`: \`dev.silver.customers_clean\` → \`prod.silver.customers_clean\`
- \`cleanse.columns.email.case\`: \`lower\` → \`upper\`
- \`cleanse.columns.last_seen.timezone.from\`: \`Europe/London\` → not set
- \`cleanse.columns.last_seen.timezone.to\`: \`UTC\` → not set
- \`cleanse.columns.updated_at.timezone.from\`: \`Europe/London\` → not set
- \`cleanse.columns.updated_at.timezone.to\`: \`UTC\` → not set
- \`quarantine\`: \`dev.silver.customers_clean_quarantine\` → \`prod.silver.customers_clean_quarantine\`

## Table orders_clean

